+> **Service status:** this release serves migration mode. Gameplay is paused; migration has
+> not happened, nothing is claimable, and no wallet action is needed. Legacy gameplay APIs
+> return 503 before loading their store dependencies. `/api/proof` and `/api/supply` remain
+> available as diagnostic routes but still use KV and public RPC and may be stale or fail.
+> The gameplay and recovery instructions below describe the historical implementation.
+> This source change alone is not a deployment receipt or a mainnet release.
+
+The deployment setting `RATCHETX_SITE_MODE` defaults to migration mode. Keep it
+unset or set to `migration` for this release. Only the exact value `legacy` enables
+the preserved backend and its durable-store build prerequisite; a request cannot
+change this setting. Restoring legacy backend mode does not restore public page
+routing or scheduled jobs: those require a separate, reviewed configuration change.
+The test runner sets `legacy` for historical suites; the migration suite independently
+checks the default mode, including HTTP requests, without inheriting that setting.
+
